# The settlement PDF supplied with the project. It is a scan of a filled-in
# SAMPLE sheet - another driver's trip on page 1 - hidden under white
# rectangles. public/settlement-template.pdf is built from it with that data
# permanently removed, and is committed, so the app and its tests do not need
# this file. Keep it locally if you want to re-run `npm run build:template`.
